This repository includes material from OpenAI's mathematics repository,
https://github.com/openai/math, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
Lean statements and proofs, excerpts of papers, and scope notes, in
docs/examples/, tests/fixtures/ and benchmarks/statement-plants.json, and
statement copies that Scry's benchmark changes on purpose (each change is
described in benchmarks/statement-plants.json). Proof maps and outlines made
from those proofs hold Lean's own printing of them.

AlphaProof's published proofs (Google DeepMind) are not included. Scry
downloads them on request and checks them against a recorded fingerprint.
